B.aUH=new A.hv(B.ey,"Green means the backend exists \u2014 not wishful thinking","This audit checks the actual BridgePoint backend for the systems we locked in. REVIEW and NEEDS CONNECTION stay visible until the external provider or real-world test is complete.",null)
B.aUI=new A.hv(B.kW,"A model is a question\u2014not a prediction of a guaranteed sale","Each model asks whether a property has enough recent, reliable and diverse evidence for a specific customer need. Confidence measures evidence reliability. The strict score prioritizes qualified properties. Only scores of 78+ enter the published queue.",null)
B.aUJ=new A.hv(B.ez,"BridgePoint prepares the next outreach move automatically","The system ranks customer-lane prospects and separates customer acquisition from multipliers and strategic targets. Real Apollo enrollment or sending still uses an approved sender/sequence confirmation, so an automation mistake cannot blast your mailbox.",null)
B.aUK=new A.hv(B.kS,"From first signal through paid claim","Save a promising opportunity, qualify it, open a private claim workflow, record each milestone, attach notes and schedule the next action. Public evidence updates automatically; carrier details appear only when you enter them or authorize an integration.",null)
B.a2j=new A.I(61381,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aUL=new A.hv(B.a2j,"Field route","Route order is an efficiency aid. Obey traffic, safety, access and no-soliciting rules. Do not interact with BridgePoint while driving.",null)
B.aUM=new A.hv(B.iY,"Backup access is prepared and waiting for an email","When you choose a trusted person, enter their email below. After they verify their own account, they become your company co-owner and a backup platform administrator. The primary owner cannot be removed by the co-owner.",null)
B.aUN=new A.hv(B.kP,"Give yourself the information advantage","Add your home to BridgePoint. My Home combines public property records, property timeline intelligence, weather/storm context, your own systems and service history, documents, warranties, improvements, belongings, maintenance, and neighborhood changes in one private Home Passport.",null)
B.aUO=new A.hv(B.cC,"Live expansion progress \u2014 without fake countdowns","BridgePoint shows measured build time when live throughput is available. Queued states show their real queue position instead of an invented clock ETA. Markets remain locked from purchase until property data, automatic sources, scoring, security and final activation checks are complete.",null)
B.aUP=new A.hv(B.ey,"Property facts, not personal allegations","Your observation is stored separately from BridgePoint\u2019s interpretation. Public posts can be moderated, corroborated, disputed, or removed. Trusted observations can improve BridgePoint intelligence; one person cannot unilaterally create a verified property fact.",null)
B.aUQ=new A.hv(B.ez,"A few plans are featured on purpose","BridgePoint highlights the clearest starting points first. Use the dropdown or Show more to compare specialty, enterprise and technology products without scrolling through a wall of plans.",null)
B.aUR=new A.hv(B.j1,"What this proves","This confirms the registration record and its reported status. It does not prove technical skill, insurance, workmanship, complaint history, or suitability. Verify the official record and current insurance before work.",null)
B.aUS=new A.hv(B.dG,"BridgePoint keeps facts separate from inference","Public records, owner-entered facts, professional evidence, and BridgePoint-derived intelligence remain labeled separately. BridgePoint will not tell you a roof, system, or home is \u201cbad\u201d just because of age or a single data point.",null)
B.aUT=new A.hv(B.fE,"Every good observation can make BridgePoint smarter","Published community observations show what was observed, when, and the verified contributor label. BridgePoint adds a separate \u201cwhat this may mean\u201d interpretation. Corroborated, trusted observations can become proprietary evidence and signals; disputed or removed observations are suppressed from learning.",null)
B.aUU=new A.hv(B.AQ,"You buy the intelligence\u2014not BridgePoint\u2019s internal recipe","Pattern customers receive protected outputs, concentration, recency, confidence, geography and supporting counts. Raw weights, learning logic, internal SQL and unrestricted backend access stay private.",null)
B.aUV=new A.hv(B.nC,"You do not have to memorize BridgePoint","Pick a package. Demo Mode gives you an opener, discovery question, screen sequence, \u201csay this,\u201d \u201cshow this,\u201d proof point, objection response, transition and close.",null)
B.aUW=new A.hv(B.f_,"Choose a location","Search an address, city, ZIP code, or use your current location. Save the places you care about and BridgePoint will keep weather, alerts, field windows, and nearby opportunities together.",null)
